  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><munder><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>mol</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mtext>mol</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.72</mn><mtext>mol</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>72</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>24</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br />In the present case, reactant 'C' will be the limiting reactant because it will give least amount of product on being completely consumed.<br />As 3 mol C gives 1 mol product,<br />So 0.72 mol C will give 0.24 mol of product.</p>",
